@{
Layout = null;
}

<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="tr">
<head>
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
    <title>OGC GML (Geography Markup Language) Eğitim Sayfası</title>

    <link href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap@5.3.0/dist/css/bootstrap.min.css" rel="stylesheet">
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@300;400;600&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.5.1/css/all.min.css">

    <style>
        /* Genel Stil: Mevcut portalınızdaki stiller korunmuştur. */
        body { font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif; background-color: #f4f7f6; color: #333; }
        .navbar { background: linear-gradient(135deg, #1d457c 0%, #0099cc 100%); } 
        .card { border: none; border-radius: 12px; box-shadow: 0 2px 15px rgba(0,0,0,0.05); margin-bottom: 20px; }
        .card-header { background-color: #fff; border-bottom: 1px solid #eee; font-weight: 600; color: #1d457c; }
        /* GML için özel renk teması */
        .gml-code-block { background-color: #f0f4f7; color: #404040; padding: 15px; border-radius: 8px; font-family: 'Consolas', monospace; font-size: 0.8rem; overflow-x: auto; white-space: pre-wrap; border: 1px solid #cceeff; }
        .xml-tag { color: #8800ff; font-weight: bold; } /* XML Tagları için mor */
        .xml-attribute { color: #ff6600; } /* XML Attributeleri için turuncu */
        .xml-value { color: #008800; } /* XML Değerleri için yeşil */
        .gml-type-badge { background-color: #ccf2ff; color: #1d457c; padding: 4px 8px; border-radius: 4px; font-family: monospace; font-weight: bold; }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

<nav class="navbar navbar-expand-lg navbar-dark mb-4">
    <div class="container">
        <a class="navbar-brand" href="#">
            <i class="fas fa-code me-2"></i> OGC GML (Geography Markup Language) Eğitimi
        </a>
    </div>
</nav>

<div class="container">
    <div class="row">
        
        <div class="col-lg-5">
            
            <div class="card">
                <div class="card-header">
                    <i class="fas fa-book me-1"></i> GML Nedir? (Coğrafya İşaretleme Dili)
                </div>
                <div class="card-body">
                    <p>GML, **vektör coğrafi verileri** (noktalar, çizgiler, çokgenler) internet üzerinden aktarmak için tasarlanmış bir **XML** dilidir. $\text{OGC}$'nin $\text{WFS}$ (Web Feature Service) standardının temel çıktı formatıdır.</p>
                    <hr>
                    <h6>🔑 Temel Yapıtaşları:</h6>
                    <ul class="list-unstyled small">
                        <li class="mb-2"><i class="fas fa-tag me-2 text-primary"></i> <span class="xml-tag">&lt;gml:FeatureCollection&gt;</span>: Tüm veri setini kapsayan ana kapsayıcı.</li>
                        <li class="mb-2"><i class="fas fa-tag me-2 text-primary"></i> <span class="xml-tag">&lt;gml:featureMember&gt;</span>: Her bir coğrafi objeyi (örneğin bir bina, bir eyalet) temsil eden kapsayıcı.</li>
                        <li class="mb-2"><i class="fas fa-tag me-2 text-primary"></i> <span class="xml-tag">&lt;gml:Point&gt;</span>, <span class="xml-tag">&lt;gml:LineString&gt;</span>, <span class="xml-tag">&lt;gml:Polygon&gt;</span>: Coğrafi geometrinin kendisini tanımlar.</li>
                        <li class="mb-2"><i class="fas fa-tag me-2 text-primary"></i> <span class="xml-tag">&lt;ogr:ID&gt;</span>: Objeye ait özgün öznitelik (attribute) verileri.</li>
                    </ul>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="card bg-light">
                <div class="card-header">
                    <i class="fas fa-exchange-alt me-1"></i> GML vs. GeoJSON
                </div>
                <div class="card-body">
                    <table class="table table-sm table-bordered small">
                        <thead>
                            <tr>
                                <th>Özellik</th>
                                <th>GML (XML)</th>
                                <th>GeoJSON (JSON)</th>
                            </tr>
                        </thead>
                        <tbody>
                            <tr>
                                <td>**Format**</td>
                                <td><span class="badge bg-warning text-dark">XML</span> (Genişletilebilir İşaretleme Dili)</td>
                                <td><span class="badge bg-info text-dark">JSON</span> (JavaScript Nesne Notasyonu)</td>
                            </tr>
                            <tr>
                                <td>**Dosya Boyutu**</td>
                                <td>Genellikle **daha büyüktür** (Tekrarlayan etiketler nedeniyle)</td>
                                <td>Genellikle **daha küçüktür**</td>
                            </tr>
                            <tr>
                                <td>**Okunabilirlik**</td>
                                <td>Makine ve programlar için **kesin** ve şemaya bağlıdır.</td>
                                <td>İnsanlar ve web tarayıcıları için **daha kolaydır**.</td>
                            </tr>
                            <tr>
                                <td>**Web İstemcisi**</td>
                                <td>Doğrudan işlenmesi zordur (Ek **kütüphane** gerektirir).</td>
                                <td>JavaScript ve Leaflet ile **doğrudan** çizilebilir.</td>
                            </tr>
                        </tbody>
                    </table>
                </div>
            </div>
            
        </div>

        <div class="col-lg-7">

            <div class="card">
                <div class="card-header">
                    <i class="fas fa-code me-1"></i> 1. GML Temel XML Şablonu (WFS GetFeature)
                </div>
                <div class="card-body p-0">
                    <div class="gml-code-block">
                        &lt;<span class="xml-tag">wfs:FeatureCollection</span> <span class="xml-attribute">xmlns:wfs</span>=<span class="xml-value">"http://www.opengis.net/wfs"</span> ...&gt;
  &lt;<span class="xml-tag">wfs:featureMember</span>&gt;
    &lt;<span class="xml-tag">topp:states</span> <span class="xml-attribute">gml:id</span>=<span class="xml-value">"states.1"</span>&gt;
      &lt;<span class="xml-tag">topp:the_geom</span>&gt;
        &lt;<span class="xml-tag">gml:MultiPolygon</span> <span class="xml-attribute">srsName</span>=<span class="xml-value">"EPSG:4326"</span>&gt;
          ... Geometri Verisi ...
        &lt;/<span class="xml-tag">gml:MultiPolygon</span>&gt;
      &lt;/<span class="xml-tag">topp:the_geom</span>&gt;
      &lt;<span class="xml-tag">topp:STATE_NAME</span>&gt;<span class="xml-value">California</span>&lt;/<span class="xml-tag">topp:STATE_NAME</span>&gt;
      &lt;<span class="xml-tag">topp:POP1990</span>&gt;<span class="xml-value">29760021</span>&lt;/<span class="xml-tag">topp:POP1990</span>&gt;
    &lt;/<span class="xml-tag">topp:states</span>&gt;
  &lt;/<span class="xml-tag">wfs:featureMember</span>&gt;
&lt;/<span class="xml-tag">wfs:FeatureCollection</span>&gt;
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="card">
                <div class="card-header">
                    <i class="fas fa-map-marker-alt me-1"></i> 2. GML Nokta (Point) Örneği
                </div>
                <div class="card-body p-0">
                    <div class="gml-code-block">
                        <span class="gml-type-badge">Nokta Objeleri (GML 3.2.1)</span>
&lt;<span class="xml-tag">gml:Point</span> <span class="xml-attribute">srsName</span>=<span class="xml-value">"EPSG:4326"</span> <span class="xml-attribute">gml:id</span>=<span class="xml-value">"p1"</span>&gt;
  &lt;<span class="xml-tag">gml:pos</span>&gt;<span class="xml-value">39.93 32.85</span>&lt;/<span class="xml-tag">gml:pos</span>&gt;
&lt;/<span class="xml-tag">gml:Point</span>&gt;

<span class="gml-type-badge">Koşut Dizisi (GML 2)</span>
&lt;<span class="xml-tag">gml:coordinates</span> <span class="xml-attribute">cs</span>=<span class="xml-value">","</span> <span class="xml-attribute">ts</span>=<span class="xml-value">" "</span>&gt;<span class="xml-value">32.85,39.93</span>&lt;/<span class="xml-tag">gml:coordinates</span>&gt; 
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="card">
                <div class="card-header">
                    <i class="fas fa-bezier-curve me-1"></i> 3. GML Çizgi (LineString) Örneği
                </div>
                <div class="card-body p-0">
                    <div class="gml-code-block">
                        <span class="gml-type-badge">Çizgi Objeleri (GML 3.2.1)</span>
&lt;<span class="xml-tag">gml:LineString</span> <span class="xml-attribute">srsName</span>=<span class="xml-value">"EPSG:4326"</span>&gt;
  &lt;<span class="xml-tag">gml:posList</span>&gt;
    <span class="xml-value">32.85 39.93 32.95 39.85 33.10 39.75</span>
  &lt;/<span class="xml-tag">gml:posList</span>&gt;
&lt;/<span class="xml-tag">gml:LineString</span>&gt;
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
            
            <div class="card">
                <div class="card-header">
                    <i class="fas fa-draw-polygon me-1"></i> 4. GML Alan (Polygon) Yapısı
                </div>
                <div class="card-body p-0">
                    <div class="gml-code-block">
                        <span class="gml-type-badge">Çokgen (GML 3.2.1) - Dış ve İç Halka (Dış/İç Sınırlar)</span>
&lt;<span class="xml-tag">gml:Polygon</span>&gt;
  &lt;<span class="xml-tag">gml:exterior</span>&gt; &lt;<span class="xml-tag">gml:LinearRing</span>&gt;
    &lt;<span class="xml-tag">gml:posList</span>&gt; ... Dış Çevre Koordinatları ... &lt;/<span class="xml-tag">gml:posList</span>&gt;
  &lt;/<span class="xml-tag">gml:LinearRing</span>&gt; &lt;/<span class="xml-tag">gml:exterior</span>&gt;
  
  &lt;<span class="xml-tag">gml:interior</span>&gt; &lt;<span class="xml-tag">gml:LinearRing</span>&gt;
    &lt;<span class="xml-tag">gml:posList</span>&gt; ... İç Boşluk (Ada/Göl) Koordinatları ... &lt;/<span class="xml-tag">gml:posList</span>&gt;
  &lt;/<span class="xml-tag">gml:LinearRing</span>&gt; &lt;/<span class="xml-tag">gml:interior</span>&gt;
&lt;/<span class="xml-tag">gml:Polygon</span>&gt;
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>

        </div>
    </div>
</div>

<footer class="text-center py-4 text-muted mt-5 border-top">
    <div class="container">
        <p class="mb-0">owsLab - GML Formatı Detaylı İnceleme Demosu</p>
    </div>
</footer>

<script src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap@5.3.0/dist/js/bootstrap.bundle.min.js"></script>

</body>
</html>